# Soft Glass · Primary, global default (LOCKED)

When creating a Soft Glass primary field group (glass input, glass select, and glass search), use the lock in `src/Products/PinoyBusinessPOS/ExItS.PinoyBusinessPOS.React/src/features/ui-standards/soft-glass-primary-fields-global-default.ts`.

The locked command is `ext soft-glass primary global-default`.

The Input UI standard card titled **Soft Glass · Primary, global default** is this lock. It sits under the Input playground.

## Fields

- Input: locked `PlaygroundTextField` (`ext input primary outlined`), clearable. Clear mark is the locked primary **X** (`exits-search-clear-default.mdc`).
- Select: locked `CompactSelect` (`ext dropdown primary outlined`).
- Search: locked `PlaygroundSearchField` (search icon + clear). Search radius stays `0.75rem`.
- All three are `SOFT_GLASS_PRIMARY_FIELDS_WIDTH` = **18rem**.
- Color follows Preferences primary: `SOFT_GLASS_PRIMARY_FIELDS_COLOR` = `var(--exits-primary)`.
- Field and menu radius stay `SOFT_GLASS_FIELD_RADIUS` (`0.6875rem`). Do not use the Soft Glass shell `1.1rem` on these fields.

## Label

Same motion as Add local person (`people-add-dialog--soft-glass`):

- Duration: `SOFT_GLASS_PRIMARY_FIELDS_LABEL_DURATION` = **0.45s** on the label and the bottom bar
- Raised label: flush start, no surface chip (`left: 0`, `padding-inline: 0`, `background: transparent`)
- Lift: `translateY(SOFT_GLASS_PRIMARY_FIELDS_LABEL_LIFT)` = `translateY(calc(-50% - 0.85rem))`
- Soft Glass date / date-time triggers (**Soft Glass Roll · Primary, global default**) use this same label motion — see `exits-soft-glass-datetime.mdc`

## Select menu

- Border: `SOFT_GLASS_PRIMARY_FIELDS_MENU_BORDER` = **2px**
- Option radius: `SOFT_GLASS_PRIMARY_FIELDS_OPTION_RADIUS` = **3px** (hover and selected). This is the option row, not the field radius.
- Hover: Soft Glass wash in light and dark
- Selected: Soft Glass wash plus a thick primary start edge, `inset SOFT_GLASS_PRIMARY_FIELDS_SELECTED_EDGE` = **inset 3px 0 0**. Light selected text is primary. Dark selected text is white.

Change this lock only when the user asks. Update `soft-glass-primary-fields-global-default.ts`, `soft-glass-primary-fields-global-default.test.ts`, `.ui-standards-soft-glass-primary-fields` in `ui-standards.css`, and this rule together.
